/*
 * Tentacles surge up from under the pier and grab your rod, trying to pull you in. You can let go (safe), banish them with angel power, or hold on with
 * an athletics check. Failing the check either gets you rescued by the NPC fisher if they're present, or pulls you into Sea Tentacles.
 * There's a todo for breaking the rod as a wardrobe item on the failed-rescue outcome.
 */
:: Fishing Pier Tentacles
Tentacles surge up from the water and coil around your fishing rod, trying to pull it and you in.
<br><br>

<<if $angel gte 4 and $angelBanish gte 1>>
	<<link [[Banish the tentacles|Fishing Pier Tentacles Banish]]>><<angelBanishUse>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

<<link [[Let go|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Hold on|Fishing Pier Tentacles Hold]]>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty 600 1200>>


:: Fishing Pier Tentacles Banish
You focus your mind on the tentacles coiling around your rod, then make an intricate gesture with your hand. <span class="green">The tentacles shimmer and recoil violently,</span> releasing their grip and retreating into the depths. <<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Pier Tentacles Hold
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	<span class="green">You brace and wrench the rod free from the tentacles' grip.</span>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<if $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.phase is "fishing" and random(1, 2) is 1>>
		<span class="red">The tentacles yank hard,</span> but the <<person1>><<person>> next to you grabs you before you can be pulled in. Your rod slips from your hands and disappears into the sea. <<stress 3>><<gstress>>
		<br><br>
		/* fishing todo: break rod for wardrobe */

		"You okay?" <<he>> asks, breathing hard.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Fisher Thank Normal]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Thank <<him>> with a kiss|Fishing Pier Fisher Thank Kiss]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<promiscuous1>><<kissvirginitywarning>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">The tentacles yank hard, dragging you off the pier and into the water.</span> <<stress 10>><<ggstress>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Sea Tentacles]]>><<location "seadocks">><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

